<p>You spin around madly with your shield, bashing all those around you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">164%, 183%, 197%, 209%, 220%</acronym> shield damage as darkness, confusing your foes for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>At level 4 you also automatically block at the end.</p>